UPDATE public.questions SET explanation = 'Technical Rationale: Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) introduces governance checkpoints into autonomous AI workflows. When an agent needs to perform critical, high-impact, or irreversible actions (e.g. approving a purchase order, changing employee salary, issuing credit), HITL pauses execution and requests explicit human review and authorization before proceeding.
