UPDATE public.questions SET explanation = 'Technical Rationale: Oracle Database 23ai DDL restrictions on VECTOR columns:
• You CANNOT alter/modify an existing VECTOR column to a non-vector datatype (e.g. VARCHAR2, NUMBER) or vice-versa using ALTER TABLE MODIFY.
• Permitted operations: You CAN add new VECTOR columns, drop existing VECTOR columns, and create new tables with CTAS (CREATE TABLE AS SELECT).
